# into this file.
# Added here: Defeat Nek'rosh (474), Sully Balloo's Letter (637), Ironband Wants You! (707), Sara Balloo's Plea (683),
# The Thandol Span (632, 633), Plea to the Alliance (634, handed in at Refuge Pointe in 05-arathi-highlands) and, on the
# Defeat Nek'rosh group branch, This Land Was Their Land (98230), which Captain Stoutfist offers only after 474 is handed in (#1299).
# Solo players never see it (when group 474). Howin's Word to Ironforge (98300) is left out: he offers it only after Death to the
# Dragonmaw (98291) and Stopping the Cycle (98297), which the route does not take.
# Spark of Freedom (87491) is a group quest (#1313): its escort starts at the far west of Dun Modr's elite Dark Iron ruins.
# The Dark Iron War (303, the ruins' elites) and Bring Back a Bang (88756, the explosives on Direforge Hill among the same
# elites) are group quests on the same stop (#2587): asked like Spark of Freedom, never on the solo route.
# MacKreel's Moonshine (647) is taken in 05-arathi-highlands: its 15-minute limit does not last the walk to Menethil and the boat (#1319).
# Level tidy (0.4.0): Lifting the Curse (290), The Eye of Paleth (292) and Cleansing the Eye (293) are taken on the
# Menethil stop at about 31 (Captain Halyndor is 30) instead of at 28 in 06-wetlands; 293 goes to Archbishop Benedictus on
# this guide's Stormwind stop. The Syndicate camp (Syndicate Assassins 505, 510, 511) is worked in 05-arathi-highlands at
# about 37: its Thieves are 33-34 and its Wizards 34-35, two and three levels over players here. Magistrate Maleb's quest is
# taken on this Southshore stop, where the route already passes him, and carried to that trip.

