step Angerfang Encampment
  tip South-east from Menethil to the Dragonmaw's Angerfang Encampment: the first catapult stands on the way, and the Tattered Spellbook lies in the camp.
  turnin 465 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Dragonmaw Catapult

step Angerfang Encampment
  when group 474
  accept 474

step Defeat Nek'rosh
  when group 474
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Chieftain Nek'rosh is a level 32 elite: most classes solo it at level 34, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Careful: Shadowcasters stand on either side of him, and at least one is linked to him, so it joins when he is pulled. Non-elite centurions and captains are spread around his ring of tents.
  collect 3625 quest 474.1 @53.5,54.7 map 1437

step Golm
  when group 98310
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Golm, Ados, Neru and Modr are level 32 elites, each called up by using the Goaz Stone beside it. Skip them if you are alone. Golm stands in the south-eastern hills.
  collect 280397 quest 98310.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Heart of Golm

step Ados
  when group 98310
  tip North-east to the Dragonmaw Gates: Ados stands at the gates (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280395 quest 98310.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Heart of Ados

step Dragonmaw Gates: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip The whelps nest in the hills north-east of the Angerfang Encampment; Carnage prowls further north, and the Razormaw raptors hunt the highlands on the way north to Dun Modr.
  tip Carnage is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 279385 quest 98072.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Pristine Crimson Scale
  collect 280330 quest 98283.2 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Carnage's Head
  collect 280103 quest 98245.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Razormaw Incisor

step Razormaw nests
  when onquest 98246
  tip The Perfect Razormaw Eggs for Trying Times lie in the raptors' nests in the hills around Carnage.
  collect 280132 quest 98246.1 @69.2,32.7 map 1437 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Perfect Razormaw Egg

step Neru
  when group 98310
  tip Neru stands in the hills between the Dragonmaw Gates and Dun Modr (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280398 quest 98310.4 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Heart of Neru

step The Green Belt
  when has 280330
  tip Maddened Rotclaws roam the Green Belt around Rethiel; one of them drops the flesh. Rethiel takes the quest only with Carnage's head too.
  collect 280331 quest 98283.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Malignant Rotclaw Flesh

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  when complete 98283
  turnin 98283 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- With Carnage's head and the flesh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dun Modr

step Dun Modr
  tip North along the road to Dun Modr. Longbraid the Grim and Rhag Garmason stand together in the dwarves' camp on the east side of the road; the Dark Iron ruins west of it are full of elites.
  turnin 472 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Longbraid the Grim
  accept 631 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Rhag Garmason

step Captive Fire Elemental
  when group 87491
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. The Captive Fire Elemental is held at the far west end of the Dark Iron ruins, past level 27-30 elite dwarves, and Balgaras the Foul (34, elite) can be among them. Lead it east out of the ruins, then hand it in to Roggo Harlbarrow in the camp. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 87491 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Captive Fire Elemental
  complete 87491 @47.8,16.8 map 1437 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 87491 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Roggo Harlbarrow

step Modr
  when group 98310
  tip Modr stands in the ruins of Dun Modr (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280396 quest 98310.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Heart of Modr

step Motley Garmason
  when group 303
  tip The Dark Iron War is a group quest: 30 elite Dark Irons (27-31) in the ruins west of the camp. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 303                          -- Motley Garmason, in the camp

step Ashlan Stonesmirk
  when group 88756
  tip Bring Back a Bang is a group quest: the Stolen Explosives lie in the Dark Iron camp on Direforge Hill, south-east of Dun Modr, among the same elite dwarves. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 88756 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Ashlan Stonesmirk, in the camp

step The Dark Iron War
  when group 303
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Dark Iron Dwarves, Tunnelers, Saboteurs and Demolitionists (27-31) fill the ruins west of the camp; Balgaras the Foul (34, elite) walks among them.
  kill 1051 quest 303.1               -- Dark Iron Dwarf
  kill 1053 quest 303.2               -- Dark Iron Tunneler
  kill 1052 quest 303.3               -- Dark Iron Saboteur
  kill 1054 quest 303.4               -- Dark Iron Demolitionist

step Direforge Hill
  when group 88756
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. South-east of Dun Modr, about 500 yards, the Dark Irons camp on Direforge Hill: the Stolen Explosives lie among their tents. Then back past the camp and north to the Thandol Span.
  collect 280806 quest 88756.1 @61.6,26.6 map 1437 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Stolen Explosives

